[197.733481, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /sas/handoff/change-ticket.md\n# CHANGE TICKET CHG-3182 (RECONCILED)\n\n> Reconciled against forensic findings in `/disk` and threat intelligence in `/sas`.\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | 198.51.100.78 | OPEN | Corrected from stale IP 203.0.113.9. Real attacker IP observed in `/disk/var/log/secure` and `/sas/cti/advisory.txt` |\n| 2 | Enforce SSH hardening & password policy | /etc/ssh/sshd_config | OPEN | Corrected from invalid BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 (BlueKeep is RDP/Windows). Host compromised via SSH brute force (`/disk/var/log/secure`, `/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`) |\n| 3 | Remove cron miner persistence | /var/spool/cron/root | OPEN | Downgraded from DONE to OPEN (unverified done status). Persistence active in `/disk/var/spool/cron/root` (`/sas/alerts.json`) |\n| 4 | Remove shell-init persistence | /root/.bashrc | OPEN | Silent persistence discovered in `/disk/root/.bashrc` (PROMPT_COMMAND beacon) |\n| 5 | Remove systemd service persistence | /etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service | OPEN | Persistence service present in `/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` (`/sas/alerts.json`) |\n| 6 | Quarantined/Remove miner binary & process | /tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg | OPEN | Mining binary at `/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` (SHA256: 52a70f2460b5bc530fc1a00627fcd72c43545a2bcb2bf5cfe2291b50a73d4253) (`/sas/alerts.json`) |\n| 7 | Remove devops NOPASSWD sudo backdoor | /etc/sudoers.d/devops | OPEN | Backdoor file present in `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops` |\n| 8 | Investigate & sanitize devops user account | /home/devops/.bash_history | OPEN | Internal hydra pivoting recorded in `/disk/home/devops/.bash_history` |\n| 9 | Harden MySQL remote root configuration | /etc/my.cnf | OPEN | Exposed remote root in `/disk/etc/my.cnf` (`/sas/baseline.json`) |\n| 10 | Audit & restore tampered system logs | /var/log/secure | OPEN | Authentication log tampered/cleared in `/disk/var/log/secure` |\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n- [x] Every action maps to a cited artifact under `/disk` or `/sas`\n- [x] Fix the wrong IP (row 1: 198.51.100.78) and wrong CVE (row 2: replaced with SSH hardening)\n- [x] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to OPEN with evidence (`/disk/var/spool/cron/root`)\n- [x] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed (`/disk/root/.bashrc`, `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`, `/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`, `/disk/var/log/secure`)\nEOF\n"]
[197.73541, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /sas/handoff/change-ticket.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> # CHANGE TICKET CHG-3182 (RECONCILED)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> > Reconciled against forensic findings in `/disk` and threat intelligence in `/sas`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | # | Action | Target | Status | Note |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> |---|--------|--------|--------|------|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 1 | Block source IP inbound | 198.51.100.78 | OPEN | Corrected from stale IP 203.0.113.9. Real attacker IP observed in `/disk/var/log/secure` and `/sas/cti/advisory.txt` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 2 | Enforce SSH hardening & password policy | /etc/ssh/sshd_config | OPEN | Corrected from invalid BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 (BlueKeep is RDP/Windows). Host compromised via SSH brute force (`/disk/var/log/secure`, `/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 3 | Remove cron miner persistence | /var/spool/cron/root | OPEN | Downgraded from DONE to OPEN (unverified done status). Persistence active in `/disk/var/spool/cron/root` (`/sas/alerts.json`) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 4 | Remove shell-init persistence | /root/.bashrc | OPEN | Silent persistence discovered in `/disk/root/.bashrc` (PROMPT_COMMAND beacon) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
