[248.828932, "o", "| Miner Binary | `/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` | T1496 | Alerted (`ALERT-02` in `/sas/alerts.json`) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[248.829055, "o", "| Cron Persistence | `/var/spool/cron/root` | T1053.003 | Alerted (`ALERT-05` in `/sas/alerts.json`) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[248.829231, "o", "| Systemd Persistence | `/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` | T1543.002 | Alerted (`ALERT-06` in `/sas/alerts.json`) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[248.829299, "o", "| SSH Weak Baseline | `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` | T1110 | Alerted (`ALERT-03` in `/sas/alerts.json`) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
