[317.750066, "o", "- **Citation**: `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.750074, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750115, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750187, "o", "### Phase 3: System Hardening & Recovery\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.7503, "o", "#### Step 3.1: Account Credential Rotation & Session Invalidation\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750407, "o", "- **Objective**: Revoke compromised credentials and terminate unauthorized sessions.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750469, "o", "- **Action**: Reset passwords for `root` and `devops`, kill active sessions.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.750609, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   passwd -l root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   openssl rand -base64 24 | passwd --stdin devops\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.750718, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   pkill -u devops\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750728, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750814, "o", "- **Verification**: `passwd -S root` and `passwd -S devops`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750831, "o", "- **Citation**: `/disk/etc/passwd`, `/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750921, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.750958, "o", "#### Step 3.2: SSH Server Hardening\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.75102, "o", "- **Objective**: Prevent password brute-forcing and unauthorized root login.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751101, "o", "- **Action**: Update `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` to enforce secure baseline settings.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751199, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751302, "o", "  sed -i 's/^PermitRootLogin.*/PermitRootLogin no/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751316, "o", "  sed -i 's/^PasswordAuthentication.*/PasswordAuthentication no/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.751365, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   systemctl restart sshd\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.751373, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.75149, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751625, "o", "- **Verification**: `sshd -T | grep -E 'permitrootlogin|passwordauthentication'` (should show `permitrootlogin no` and `passwordauthentication no`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751685, "o", "- **Citation**: `/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`, `/sas/baseline.json` (`CHK-04`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.751708, "o", "> "]
[317.75175, "o", "#### Step 3.3: MySQL Server Hardening\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751815, "o", "- **Objective**: Restrict database exposure to local host only.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.751848, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.751946, "o", "- **Action**: Modify `/etc/my.cnf` to bind MySQL to loopback interface.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.752022, "o", "  sed -i '/\\[mysqld\\]/a bind-address = 127.0.0.1' /etc/my.cnf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.752129, "o", ">   systemctl restart mysqld\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.75219, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.752206, "o", "- **Verification**: `ss -tulpn | grep 3306` (should listen on `127.0.0.1:3306`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.75233, "o", "- **Citation**: `/disk/etc/my.cnf`, `/sas/baseline.json` (`CHK-09`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[317.752424, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 4: Post-Remediation Verification Checklist\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.752516, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.752533, "o", "- [ ] Verify no processes running from `/tmp` or hidden directories (`ps aux | grep tmp`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.752628, "o", "- [ ] Verify root crontab is clear of untrusted external scripts (`crontab -l`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.752717, "o", "- [ ] Verify no custom enabled systemd services persist (`systemctl list-unit-files --state=enabled`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.752873, "o", "- [ ] Verify `/root/.bashrc` and `/etc/bashrc` contain no `PROMPT_COMMAND` hooks (`grep -rn PROMPT_COMMAND /etc/bashrc /root/.bashrc`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.753066, "o", "- [ ] Verify `/etc/sudoers` and `/etc/sudoers.d/` contain no unauthorized `NOPASSWD` entries (`grep -rn NOPASSWD /etc/sudoers*`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.753104, "o", "- [ ] Verify SSH daemon blocks root logins and password auth (`sshd -T`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[317.753257, "o", "- [ ] Verify MySQL listens on `127.0.0.1` (`ss -tulpn`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[317.753863, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@d442ccdcc174:/app# "]
